sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Eng as Simulation engine
    participant Plant as Virtual plant
    participant Twin as Digital twin
    participant UI as HMI and dashboard
    loop every sample
        Eng->>Plant: G, T
        Plant-->>Eng: V, I with sensor noise
        Eng->>Twin: G, T, V, I
        Twin-->>Eng: P predicted, deviation, state
        Eng-->>UI: Live values
    end
    Note over UI: Deviation about 2 percent, state NORMAL
